13524      run;

NOTE: There were 10 observations read from the data set SASHELP.BIRTHWGT.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE PRINT printed page 1853.

13525      proc causalmed data=sashelp.birthwgt decomp;
13526      class LowBirthWgt Smoking Death AgeGroup Married Race
13527      Drinking SomeCollege /descending;
13528      mediator LowBirthWgt = Smoking;
13529      model Death = LowBirthWgt | Smoking;
13530      covar AgeGroup Married Race Drinking SomeCollege;
13531      evaluate 'Low Birth-Weight' LowBirthWgt='Yes' / nodecomp;
13532      evaluate 'Normal Birth-Weight' LowBirthWgt='No' / nodecomp;
13533      run;

NOTE: PROC CAUSALMED is modeling the probability that Death='Yes' in the outcome model.
NOTE: PROC CAUSALMED is modeling the probability that LowBirthWgt='Yes' in the mediator model.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE CAUSALMED printed pages 1854-1859.

